  "cover_text": "These Card Characters are a new range of LogoBugs that is manufactured by Beaker.co.uk\nBeaker LogoBugs are small single-sided shaped cards looking like drinking and eating honeybees,and are made from hand-forged tension tin,with a device where the beeswax melts down the top once it gets to its end. You can easily cut them by using a sharp knife,which is available very nearby (see Figure 2). The fact is that when you cut them,they will be pretty solid,identical to their former physical incarnation. The bees",
